# Solviax Lite → loads apps/web in a WebView (first-party cookies).
#
# Emulator / simulator: http://localhost:3004 is fine
#   Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3004
# Physical device: use your computer’s LAN IP (not localhost).
# Production store builds: https://solviax.app (HTTPS, no trailing slash).
#
# Dev web listens on port 3004 (`npm run dev:web`).
EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_URL=http://localhost:3004
